+#### Opaque model IDs
+
+Some model IDs do not name the model. Examples are application inference
+profile ARNs, provisioned-throughput ARNs and custom-model ARNs. Detection
+gives `Unknown` for these IDs. Use `BedrockModelBuilder::family` to set the
+family yourself.
+
+```rust,ignore
