+
+The override has the full effect of a detected family. It sets the default
+capabilities and the request translation. It also sets the `ToolChoice` policy
+and the local errors. These errors apply to `ResponseFormat::JsonSchema` or
+`JsonObject` with `ToolChoice::Tool` or `ToolChoice::None`. They also apply to
+`ToolChoice::Required` with no tools, and to `ToolChoice::Tool` with an
+undefined name. The `from_env` constructor cannot take the override. Use the
+builder.
+
+The `.capabilities(...)` method changes only the flags that `capabilities()`
+reports. It does not change the request. The `.capabilities(...)` value wins
+over the defaults of the family.
